# SP-011: Reduction changes whether iodine can be extracted into hexane
# Candidate experiment; expected observations are not measured results.
register lv3
add v1 water 100mL
add v1 KI 0.001mol
add v1 I2 0.0001mol
add v1 Na2S2O3 0.0002mol
new
add v2 water 100mL
add v2 KI 0.001mol
add v2 I2 0.0001mol
wait 1s
new
new
extract v1 v3 hexane 0.1mol stages 1
extract v2 v4 hexane 0.1mol stages 1
inspect
